OL,3,ADon't get caught out by new Buy Now Pay
OL,4,ALater rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf you've bought something via Buy Now
OL,7,FPay Later (BNPL) since the summer, then
OL,8,Fyou'll have been tested to see if you
OL,9,Fcan afford it.
OL,11,FBNPL has always been a type of loan,
OL,12,Fusually paid back in instalments, but
OL,13,Fit's only been officially regulated
OL,14,Fsince July.
OL,16,FThis means stricter background checks
OL,17,Fon your ability to repay.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
