OL,3,ADon't get caught out by new Buy Now Pay
OL,4,ALater rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf you fail, then your purchase via
OL,7,FBNPL will be blocked. If there's a
OL,8,Fchance of this happening to you, here
OL,9,Fare some ways to approach the
OL,10,Fsituation.
